<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
	<content contentuid="hdcf9a002g703fg43dbg9a85g45f68668ee75" version="1">年邁的乞丐</content>
	<content contentuid="h0fb4ab2egbca0g4a2ag88d3g8abc5b8dcacf" version="1">被遺忘之人</content>
	<content contentuid="hdb7f18a2g26b9g4736gb3edg9520e7a1eaac" version="1">無主之人</content>
	<content contentuid="h2875a416g6c08g4605gafeeg20fb8409a976" version="1">一個毫不起眼的老頭。身上發臭，還不停地嘟囔。仔細聽，你會發現他多麼頻繁地求人殺了他。</content>

	<content contentuid="h272f30c7g9d92g49f3g8520gdcb3e4db4df8" version="1">鐵心</content>
	<content contentuid="h3801086fgb7e1g4ccdg8fa3g3e414615ea32" version="1">寶生家的刀</content>
	<content contentuid="h485a791cg049cg49b7g92dcgd73665094dbe" version="1">沒有鞘的刀</content>
	<content contentuid="h7c1ea5f2ge2cfg48c3ga275gda8b60cfdb33" version="1">寶生家正直而英勇，照拂病弱與貧苦之人，至少人們是這樣記得的。直到食人的馬崎一族發動了那場臭名昭著的襲擊，將整條血脈盡數斬斷。只有侍奉寶生家的武士鐵心及時飲下了禁忌的龍泉之水，為馬崎所流的血報了仇。他所換來的不死之身代價高昂：各種異界之物被引到他身邊，其中就有至黑者，與他訂下了一份「英勇」的契約，許諾讓他速死。當然，那一天從未到來。</content>

	<content contentuid="h82baff6eg9a50g46a5g8ce3gee38181d681e" version="1">食屍者</content>
	<content contentuid="h69f649ecg9561g4af5g9a61g280de9100321" version="1">禁忌龍泉的饋贈</content>
	<content contentuid="hfaec5894ga99dg4618ga2a1g4eade98d3228" version="1">歸途</content>
	<content contentuid="h81214ee1g438dg49c8gbd49g8cecffd022cc" version="1">鐵心倒在他倒下的地方。只有在他倒地期間，螃蟹才會在外面。在他起身之前殺死螃蟹，兩者一同死去。</content>

	<content contentuid="h4466ff61gdf17g494ega0edgb495afb306d1" version="1">借來的英勇</content>
	<content contentuid="h4ec3d32bg5682g4432g9e14ga2de4f0481a5" version="1">&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;範圍內的盟友的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;與&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;獲得 &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="he086a0aag6bc1g4019g8a3agc0f2e769290c" version="1">長者的守護</content>
	<content contentuid="h904f04a3g523ag473aga053g9f6811995835" version="1">&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;範圍內的盟友獲得 &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; 點&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;護甲等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd488335eg4807g4439g8baag086682301d98" version="1">長壽之臭</content>
	<content contentuid="h1b5de808g8af4g4a0eg928bg44e812809d5c" version="1">&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;範圍內的敵人必須通過&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;體質&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8fef07bfg1f7cg4319g973ega7c501c1e34b" version="1">血潮</content>
	<content contentuid="h9309bf94g5b20g43d8gbe82g79c6fc4d7649" version="1">當鐵心處於&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLEEDING"&gt;流血&lt;/LSTag&gt;狀態時，&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;範圍內的敵人必須通過&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;體質&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>

	<content contentuid="h274df589g4ef7g4061gae49gbb69d9e7ed68" version="1">龍泉不肯放手</content>
	<content contentuid="h5b5419c8ge002g4bc9g8bcag9efe080e771d" version="1">鐵心在自己每個回合開始時回復 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; 點&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。沒有任何事物能打斷它，即使處於&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DOWNED"&gt;倒地&lt;/LSTag&gt;狀態。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5c63d4dag5ce2g41d4ga55eg2b3441a70ff6" version="1">修補皮囊</content>
	<content contentuid="h65e2e377g846ag4ffegb2f9g0a0a5e551733" version="1">每當攻擊或法術使鐵心受傷，他便回復 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; 點&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0567573fga23bg4668g8e5cgd98a4b010d11" version="1">以痛為供</content>
	<content contentuid="hd2799be8g2ca5g4790gb5a2g2f830a319d90" version="1">對鐵心造成的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重擊&lt;/LSTag&gt;會讓他獲得 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; 點&lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;臨時生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h48b32537g6a81g4d75g98ebg34405daca141" version="1">力道不足</content>
	<content contentuid="h39b19a70g3976g471fgb652g51a9c5c9e138" version="1">任何致命一擊都殺不死鐵心。他只會倒下，而在他倒地期間，藏在他體內的螃蟹會爬出來。在他起身之前殺死螃蟹，兩者一同死去。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2af5500ag76eag43e5ga1eag6c886a914c53" version="1">嗅得出毒</content>
	<content contentuid="h03520dcbgba05g44dbgb218g8782d0ac7933" version="1">持用者對&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;目標的攻擊擁有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;優勢&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>

	<content contentuid="hb4b1bedcg722ag4d98g8c92g1141f095de60" version="1">雙刃斬</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e11f42ag94bfg4cfag9dd1gd79bfedb9fba" version="1">鐵心以一個&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ActionPoint"&gt;動作&lt;/LSTag&gt;同時揮出雙刀，且不受通常的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;減值。</content>
	<content contentuid="h734cadfag741eg45d3ga660g0cb8a1d142bf" version="1">禮數需有回應</content>
	<content contentuid="hd5a3e7a4g7d40g4687gaa36g2f8453583957" version="1">當一名&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;超過一半的敵人擊中鐵心時，他會欺身上前，以四記斬擊作答。</content>
	<content contentuid="h32221947g3de3g4670g893dg8a7bbe67c4e1" version="1">鎖鐮</content>
	<content contentuid="haebe50f3gbcb5g4467gaf13g41901dfb0025" version="1">當敵人以遠程攻擊或法術擊中鐵心時，他會甩出帶鉤的鎖鏈將其拉到身前，並造成 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。若&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Dexterity"&gt;敏捷&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;失敗，攻擊者將&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PRONE"&gt;倒地&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>

	<content contentuid="h54120d2bgfba7g4264ga667g764b212b6c31" version="1">介錯</content>
	<content contentuid="h4c29ac3fge735g417dgb851g08fb750c026e" version="1">鐵心的主刀，忠實地侍奉了他四百年，早已浸透龍泉的魔力。</content>
	<content contentuid="h311262d6g2047g4e7eg8ef0gb264179b60cf" version="1">小慈悲</content>
	<content contentuid="h5e411073gb26fg4716g8781g206c656ad4bf" version="1">這把短刀即使在屋內也不離身。它本是為他自己的手準備的，而那一刻始終未至。</content>

	<content contentuid="he2b56119g711eg4f50g89f5g2c71742d6d22" version="1">命中時額外造成 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。目標必須通過&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;體質&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將陷入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;麻痺&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1368544dg3b47g447dgaa8bg473ebc77b4f4" version="1">命中時額外造成 &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。目標必須通過&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;體質&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將沉睡。任何傷害都會喚醒沉睡者。</content>
	<content contentuid="h49a057f9g37ecg46ebga1fbg421aa18144cc" version="1">黑漆</content>
	<content contentuid="h2c62c042g528ag4af8g9ab7g70e26345d32e" version="1">陷入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;麻痺&lt;/LSTag&gt;的生物無法移動或行動。牠自動失敗力量與敏捷&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，針對牠的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;擁有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;優勢&lt;/LSTag&gt;，且來自 [1] 之內的命中均為&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重擊&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;在每回合結束時通過&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Constitution"&gt;體質&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;即可解除該效果。</content>
	<content contentuid="h669697ffg0996g424dgbcfbg5be3719b7358" version="1">慈悲</content>
	<content contentuid="h8adf7fa5g7841g4980gbf42g821bd6f8dfce" version="1">沉睡的生物無法移動或行動。牠自動失敗力量與敏捷&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，針對牠的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;擁有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;優勢&lt;/LSTag&gt;，且來自 [1] 之內的命中均為&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重擊&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;受到任何傷害，或有同伴對其施以&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Help"&gt;幫助&lt;/LSTag&gt;時解除。</content>

	<content contentuid="hfdd821abg74eag4a07g828bge0553df0c26b" version="1">唉，還要多久！殺了我吧，可憐可憐老頭子！</content>
	<content contentuid="hcf16fcc8g5d2eg49acga4b5g648bc3db9750" version="1">你現在不殺我，就要被詛咒一輩子！</content>
	<content contentuid="hf7a0691bg3f80g4406g9747gea985a9a95e8" version="1">呼，抱歉！不，不抱歉！</content>
	<content contentuid="hdbcb9479g7b8dg4589g848fg54a14df694a5" version="1">真殘忍……卻也真仁慈。</content>

	<content contentuid="h39a7c065g758eg4e2dg8bd7g14fba6e5a137" version="1">我又回到自己的身體裡了……堂堂正正地斬下我吧。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd8114d54gd9cdg4763gb624g29cbed8de70e" version="1">至黑者，我還要向你復仇！</content>
	<content contentuid="h54984d68g09abg4e58g867cgd16b619c79cf" version="1">就照武人之道所言那樣出手——無所畏懼。</content>
	<content contentuid="heb42c4e7g0753g4eafg8aa6g876a3ee35008" version="1">那是小孩子的一擊。去找你的破綻。</content>
	<content contentuid="h85efc22dgb08dg428dgba0cgb6a24efc39ff" version="1">讓我看看你怎麼挨這一下。</content>
	<content contentuid="hefa0588ege072g4437ga261g748409b431df" version="1">我只期待與你堂堂正正一戰，別的都是恥辱。</content>
	<content contentuid="h05c818d7g4a50g4126g9006g0017b23c8777" version="1">這兩把刀切開血肉如同切奶油。</content>
	<content contentuid="he35d8867g0550g47e9g9b9bgcad3e1652fbd" version="1">別跑。我們還有得打呢！</content>
	<content contentuid="h2e047b44ge806g4d6cgbfa0geeef5063e5fa" version="1">好一擊。可惜太輕。</content>
	<content contentuid="h926911fbgb00dg44c4g8f32g6e41de9aab3e" version="1">龍泉仍抓著我不放……</content>

	<content contentuid="he51062e5g51bfg431dgb25bgfa6a83df2999" version="1">喀嚓。喀嚓。喀嚓。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb5289e60gdf15g431bg82c4ga41435cd3443" version="1">沙沙 沙沙 沙沙</content>
	<content contentuid="h803f1183gc117g4165g991dgeb88fc1235bf" version="1">喀！喀……喀……</content>
	<content contentuid="hbc56fab5ge34fg4888ga326g602584e113e3" version="1">……嚓。</content>
</contentList>
